From 04d3bf84b5d0402631c3ae9d9bce6f71b89d6a9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:51:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 142/144] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: add automatic normal BPP
 charging and hard guards

Keep BPP preparation, automatic charging, board enablement, helper ordering, calibration guards and care-hold fencing together.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  b9974f763ac95f000060c5d1201add02fe251b60 power: supply: nu1669: add board-qualified normal BPP preparation
  120110c938c4eeaa8dfcdfc98409caccba0c101c power: supply: qcom_battmgr: manage constrained automatic BPP charging
  fd195a8e81188802065d381b67b1aa00ad5a204f arm64: dts: qcom: dodge: enable calibrated automatic normal BPP charging
  e324775d2c2616ae111e8b25d948129f89b05e83 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: order automatic helpers after request primitives
  b751084a2d2deaaa212a385c0160830d668a8994 power: supply: guard automatic BPP calibration and battery hold transitions
  788cc6aba3302ab57d2bf22cde352b0526a79422 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: validate exact care hold writes
  725208c1522d8f39e6b2d70a8a083a667639f05e power: supply: qcom_battmgr: fence battery changes with automatic hard guards
